00:15:13.233 --> 00:15:14.601
Good luck, you!

274
00:15:14.668 --> 00:15:16.303
Let’s republish ‘Waegeum’

275
00:15:16.770 --> 00:15:17.905
Dad got everything ready

276
00:15:17.971 --> 00:15:19.773
I also looked into other publishers.

277
00:15:19.840 --> 00:15:22.509
Those books that aren’t out of print yet?
They started going out again

278
00:15:22.576 --> 00:15:24.678
Let’s take a look at the remaining copies

279
00:15:24.745 --> 00:15:26.780
I'm thinking about picking up one more copy.

280
00:15:27.080 --> 00:15:29.716
Now is the time, you have to do it!

281
00:15:31.485 --> 00:15:32.820
- I will.
- Uh

282
00:15:32.886 --> 00:15:33.854
Huh? really?

283
00:15:33.921 --> 00:15:36.824
All the publishers in the world disappear
Even if only you remain

284
00:15:36.890 --> 00:15:38.592
I won't do it there

285
00:15:39.359 --> 00:15:40.494
Uh...

286
00:15:41.562 --> 00:15:42.796
No!

287
00:15:42.863 --> 00:15:44.364
you have to do it with me

288
00:15:44.431 --> 00:15:48.402
I am the warehouse of that ruined publishing company.
I finally found it and figured it out.

289
00:15:48.769 --> 00:15:52.072
You made a strange contract at that time.
Someone who can solve that problem

290
00:15:52.539 --> 00:15:53.640
It's just me!

291
00:15:54.908 --> 00:15:56.276
Why are you so brave?

292
00:15:57.077 --> 00:15:59.480
You're going to be hated anyway
I decided to take it bravely, why?

293
00:15:59.546 --> 00:16:02.182
Hey, hey, don't say that
I, I, he

294
00:16:02.249 --> 00:16:04.518
Write down everything you want to say in advance
I brought it to practice

295
00:16:04.585 --> 00:16:07.821
Don't keep asking surprise questions, you
stop me

296
00:16:08.622 --> 00:16:10.724
What is it? Well, next time...

297
00:16:11.291 --> 00:16:13.460
Ah, business cards! Yeah, uh, now

298
00:16:15.195 --> 00:16:16.330
This is my business card

299
00:16:16.396 --> 00:16:18.365
Contact me about work, anytime

300
00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:22.169
- What if I don’t?
- I'll keep coming!

301
00:16:22.236 --> 00:16:23.303
underneath?

302
00:16:24.671 --> 00:16:26.006
I'll come visit you often

303
00:16:28.642 --> 00:16:30.911
I'm going to take this flower!

304
00:16:32.379 --> 00:16:33.380
Well done

305
00:16:40.153 --> 00:16:41.588
What candy is it?

306
00:16:43.824 --> 00:16:46.593
Oh, I forgot everything.
It's so loud it's killing me, really.

307
00:16:47.127 --> 00:16:48.862
- I will eat well.
- Wow, I'll eat it well.

308
00:16:48.929 --> 00:16:50.864
- Enjoy your meal.
- Enjoy your meal.

309
00:16:58.672 --> 00:17:00.507
Mmm, so delicious

310
00:17:00.574 --> 00:17:01.775
You are correct.

311
00:17:01.842 --> 00:17:03.644
The happiness of having to starve tomorrow

312
00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:05.178
Hmm

313
00:17:05.245 --> 00:17:07.247
Ah, I was reading that script.

314
00:17:07.814 --> 00:17:11.251
There was a strange fingerprint.
Can I ask you a question?

315
00:17:12.119 --> 00:17:13.854
What were you wondering?

316
00:17:14.354 --> 00:17:15.822
Kongjjiga

317
00:17:15.889 --> 00:17:17.758
I can't hold back my anger

318
00:17:17.824 --> 00:17:19.359
They sweep away all the delicacies.

319
00:17:19.426 --> 00:17:20.427
Isn’t that such a waste?

320
00:17:20.494 --> 00:17:22.095
Kongjwi must be nervous.

321
00:17:22.162 --> 00:17:23.730
You have to sweep it all away at once.

322
00:17:23.797 --> 00:17:24.665
No way

323
00:17:24.731 --> 00:17:27.401
Patjwi threw his whole body
It would be weird if I blocked it, right?

324
00:17:27.467 --> 00:17:31.505
That’s right, as long as there are no problems with the food ingredients.
It doesn't matter, right?

325
00:17:32.506 --> 00:17:33.740
Are you on medication?

326
00:17:34.875 --> 00:17:37.110
That's it, I saw that

327
00:17:37.177 --> 00:17:38.145
uh?

328
00:17:38.679 --> 00:17:40.747
I'm not smart

329
00:17:40.814 --> 00:17:43.183
Maybe you're stupid?

330
00:17:43.717 --> 00:17:45.686
If you look at this line here

331
00:17:46.353 --> 00:17:48.021
Kongjwi is also smart.

332
00:17:48.088 --> 00:17:50.857
But Patjwi is so clever

333
00:17:50.924 --> 00:17:51.992
Red beans

334
00:17:52.526 --> 00:17:53.961
Why have you been doing this since yesterday?
Are you pounding red beans?

335
00:17:54.027 --> 00:17:55.629
I'm a red bean, red bean.

336
00:17:56.730 --> 00:17:58.966
Ah, Mr. Joy now
When you think about going out on the field

337
00:17:59.032 --> 00:18:01.001
I'm very excited, red bean

338
00:18:01.535 --> 00:18:03.403
Hey, that’s annoying.

339
00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:05.305
I'm not even an employee here

340
00:18:05.372 --> 00:18:07.474
It's up to me to stir red beans, red beans.

341
00:18:09.176 --> 00:18:11.044
But then clearly

342
00:18:11.545 --> 00:18:14.147
Going out to that field
It won't be there for a while

343
00:18:14.214 --> 00:18:16.183
-You can pick it slowly.
- What?

344
00:18:16.249 --> 00:18:17.417
Driver's license

345
00:18:19.519 --> 00:18:20.854
I picked it too and got it.

346
00:18:20.921 --> 00:18:24.124
No, when the announcement was made
Wasn’t a driver’s license required?

347
00:18:24.191 --> 00:18:25.759
Oh, and Mr. Joy too.

348
00:18:25.826 --> 00:18:27.995
No, pick it slowly
Picking really slowly

349
00:18:28.061 --> 00:18:29.363
Is your social life okay?

350
00:18:29.429 --> 00:18:32.165
No, what, are you willing to do it?
How can you be so relaxed?

351
00:18:32.232 --> 00:18:34.368
Uh, uh, huh? Why are you doing this to Joy?

352
00:18:34.434 --> 00:18:37.537
You didn't instigate it
Choose your work more slowly

353
00:18:37.604 --> 00:18:39.306
In the meantime, you must have gotten your license, right?

354
00:18:39.373 --> 00:18:41.708
What do I do if I win, I’m a beginner

355
00:18:41.775 --> 00:18:44.611
A car with no driving experience
Are you sending Taerin away for a ride?

356
00:18:44.678 --> 00:18:47.147
Without any opportunity to gain experience
What career do you want?

357
00:18:47.214 --> 00:18:49.549
- I think it's absurd.
- Oh my?

358
00:18:49.616 --> 00:18:51.785
Everyone has a chance to experience
You must have been there

359
00:18:51.852 --> 00:18:54.688
No, well, everything from the beginning.
Are you good at driving?

360
00:18:54.755 --> 00:18:55.656
yes

361
00:18:55.722 --> 00:18:56.890
That's me too

362
00:18:59.926 --> 00:19:01.261
Pick it quickly

363
00:19:01.328 --> 00:19:02.896
I will practice day and night.

364
00:19:02.963 --> 00:19:04.731
Ha, I'm going crazy, really.

365
00:19:04.798 --> 00:19:06.900
I can't do on-site backup.

366
00:19:08.335 --> 00:19:11.238
What should we do with Taerin?

367
00:19:13.106 --> 00:19:14.408
Ha...

368
00:19:15.275 --> 00:19:18.245
I have to drive it myself, well.

369
00:19:18.779 --> 00:19:20.847
After filming, I lead my tired body

370
00:19:20.914 --> 00:19:24.184
It takes two hours to get from set to home.

371
00:19:24.785 --> 00:19:26.119
Red beans

372
00:19:27.654 --> 00:19:29.489
It's a blessing to be self-employed, right?

373
00:19:33.627 --> 00:19:34.561
Here it is

374
00:19:34.628 --> 00:19:36.730
Hey, you're doing this again

375
00:19:37.164 --> 00:19:40.300
If you do this every time, I'm in real trouble.

376
00:19:40.367 --> 00:19:42.035
Just give this a good water.

377
00:19:42.502 --> 00:19:43.970
Good luck, yes

378
00:19:46.039 --> 00:19:46.907
Huh?

379
00:19:47.474 --> 00:19:49.009
- What's going on?
- What, just now?

380
00:19:50.110 --> 00:19:51.244
Did you give me flowers?

381
00:19:51.311 --> 00:19:53.714
remaining flowers
Give some to nearby stores.

382
00:19:53.780 --> 00:19:56.116
I can only sell it, but I can’t.
It's fresh, but it's a waste.

383
00:19:56.183 --> 00:19:57.217
no

384
00:19:57.918 --> 00:19:59.586
-What?
- Ah

385
00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:03.690
Hyacinths, chrysanthemums and roses

386
00:20:04.191 --> 00:20:05.425
Would you like to take some too? There are some left

387
00:20:05.492 --> 00:20:07.294
No!

388
00:20:08.695 --> 00:20:09.930
No, that...

389
00:20:09.996 --> 00:20:11.498
Why are you giving me that?

390
00:20:11.865 --> 00:20:13.967
be very misunderstood
Say goodbye, why?

391
00:20:14.034 --> 00:20:15.836
Why do you misunderstand?

392
00:20:16.303 --> 00:20:18.004
I do it, I do it!

393
00:20:18.071 --> 00:20:19.506
you don't do that

394
00:20:21.508 --> 00:20:22.542
Follow me

395
00:20:25.245 --> 00:20:26.379
Ah...

396
00:20:28.849 --> 00:20:30.417
Hey, hey, Jeyeon, Seong Jeyeon!

397
00:20:33.653 --> 00:20:34.621
Oh no

398
00:20:35.088 --> 00:20:36.556
Take it slow

399
00:20:39.059 --> 00:20:40.994
Are there any scissors this small?

400
00:20:41.061 --> 00:20:42.162
Anything big?

401
00:20:42.629 --> 00:20:44.097
Uh, what about poisonous flowers?

402
00:20:44.564 --> 00:20:46.500
Ah, hey, you shouldn't sell things like that.

403
00:20:47.033 --> 00:20:49.469
uh, this is good

404
00:20:49.536 --> 00:20:51.404
Can people come in?

405
00:20:56.676 --> 00:20:57.911
Why are you doing this?

406
00:20:58.712 --> 00:20:59.846
Ah

407
00:20:59.913 --> 00:21:02.549
Taerin is starting a new project.

408
00:21:02.616 --> 00:21:04.351
I guess I got a little caught up in it.

409
00:21:04.751 --> 00:21:06.686
No, you said you were taking a break?

410
00:21:08.355 --> 00:21:09.289
uh?

411
00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:11.491
Motaerin nemyeon

412
00:21:11.558 --> 00:21:14.327
It's the company that didn't have that chair back then.

413
00:21:14.394 --> 00:21:16.029
- You, ugh...
- Huh?

414
00:21:16.096 --> 00:21:17.430
What is this?

415
00:21:18.532 --> 00:21:19.766
Oh, that?

416
00:21:20.200 --> 00:21:23.603
Last time I went to the hospital to get treatment
Brochure I received when I went

417
00:21:24.204 --> 00:21:26.373
They say there are clinical trials overseas.

418
00:21:26.439 --> 00:21:28.875
Well, if it’s an overseas clinical trial

419
00:21:29.276 --> 00:21:32.479
a few months in that country
Doesn't it have to be permanent?

420
00:21:32.913 --> 00:21:36.149
Do masks heal?

421
00:21:36.216 --> 00:21:38.952
You won't know until you try
Me and the doctor

422
00:21:40.387 --> 00:21:42.255
I've been having a bad day lately.

423
00:21:42.322 --> 00:21:43.957
Just like last time

424
00:21:44.024 --> 00:21:47.027
A little bit of progress
They say it's fast

425
00:21:58.071 --> 00:21:59.306
No, that...

426
00:22:02.108 --> 00:22:03.577
Well, no...

427
00:22:05.812 --> 00:22:07.280
New Testament too

428
00:22:07.347 --> 00:22:09.249
It keeps coming out

429
00:22:11.117 --> 00:22:13.220
We are together like this now

430
00:22:23.096 --> 00:22:24.431
Will we break through?

431
00:22:25.332 --> 00:22:26.766
It's obvious...

432
00:22:27.767 --> 00:22:29.135
We will break through

433
00:22:29.903 --> 00:22:31.705
I won't make you anxious

434
00:22:33.707 --> 00:22:34.941
Ugh!

435
00:22:36.710 --> 00:22:37.677
ah!

436
00:22:38.478 --> 00:22:40.313
What about the bouquet? Are you finished?

437
00:22:41.147 --> 00:22:44.084
Ah, I don’t even have to tell you

438
00:22:44.150 --> 00:22:46.386
I decided to get confirmation from the PD, that is.

439
00:22:46.453 --> 00:22:48.355
I was going to show you, but wait a minute.

440
00:23:17.984 --> 00:23:19.052
No way

441
00:23:20.720 --> 00:23:23.423
Ramen really doesn't work

442
00:23:27.027 --> 00:23:29.062
Who else ordered it?

443
00:23:31.231 --> 00:23:32.766
Is this Jjajang Ramen?

444
00:23:34.968 --> 00:23:36.770
Oh, just retire.

445
00:23:40.340 --> 00:23:43.843
Who will pay for ramen when I retire?

446
00:23:51.384 --> 00:23:52.619
Seong Je-yeon!

447
00:23:56.523 --> 00:23:57.691
Director?

448
00:23:57.757 --> 00:23:59.726
Are you in a relationship these days?

449
00:23:59.793 --> 00:24:02.062
You always stopped coming when we started dating.

450
00:24:02.729 --> 00:24:04.731
When am I?

451
00:24:06.599 --> 00:24:09.569
My wife made me run errands
I have to go

452
00:24:09.636 --> 00:24:11.338
I'm leaving my keys there.

453
00:24:11.972 --> 00:24:13.073
Director

454
00:24:15.208 --> 00:24:16.343
That...

455
00:24:17.510 --> 00:24:19.479
Have you tried a long D?

456
00:24:19.546 --> 00:24:21.114
Long D?

457
00:24:21.181 --> 00:24:22.382
Are you really in a relationship?

458
00:24:22.449 --> 00:24:24.384
No, have you tried it?

459
00:24:24.451 --> 00:24:26.152
Of course I haven't tried it.

460
00:24:26.219 --> 00:24:27.887
Either you try it and let me know

461
00:24:28.388 --> 00:24:30.623
Even if you tell me, there is nothing I can do

462
00:24:31.458 --> 00:24:34.627
Just do as much as you can
Lock the door and go

463
00:24:34.894 --> 00:24:37.397
You're so stiff right now

464
00:24:37.964 --> 00:24:39.332
Please go in

465
00:24:39.399 --> 00:24:40.567
Hey

466
00:25:06.292 --> 00:25:09.095
Hey, maybe one of those ramen...

467
00:25:09.162 --> 00:25:10.864
She likes it when you tease her...

468
00:25:11.464 --> 00:25:12.632
좋아하시죠?

469
00:25:13.133 --> 00:25:14.901
Uh, uh, how...

470
00:25:14.968 --> 00:25:16.636
If I were here
I never ate it

471
00:25:16.703 --> 00:25:19.339
In an interview you did a long time ago...

472
00:25:19.406 --> 00:25:22.108
I recognized you when you came before.

473
00:25:22.175 --> 00:25:23.777
You are very shy

474
00:25:23.843 --> 00:25:25.311
I'm afraid you'll feel uncomfortable

475
00:25:25.812 --> 00:25:27.047
It's not uncomfortable

476
00:25:28.281 --> 00:25:31.418
Oh, I'd appreciate it if the ramen was spicy noodles.

477
00:25:31.484 --> 00:25:32.952
Would you like me to boil it for you when my group comes?

478
00:25:33.019 --> 00:25:35.155
I lost my mind for a moment.

479
00:25:43.363 --> 00:25:45.732
I have self-control now
This is not possible

480
00:25:45.799 --> 00:25:47.434
Can you hold on to me?

481
00:25:47.801 --> 00:25:49.602
I'm almost a wreck

482
00:25:57.343 --> 00:25:58.645
What on earth...

483
00:25:59.079 --> 00:26:00.880
What's going on here?

484
00:26:01.281 --> 00:26:02.782
I ordered ramen

485
00:26:02.849 --> 00:26:03.850
Yes?

486
00:26:07.153 --> 00:26:08.988
Can't I eat it instead?

487
00:26:09.055 --> 00:26:10.924
Count it as if you just watched a mukbang

488
00:26:10.990 --> 00:26:13.359
Ha, I thought I was in big trouble again.

489
00:26:13.827 --> 00:26:15.462
Can you stand the smell?

490
00:26:15.762 --> 00:26:18.031
Even if I ask for it
You can never give it away

491
00:26:18.098 --> 00:26:21.167
If it's just one bite, it won't have any effect.

492
00:26:21.234 --> 00:26:22.869
But never

493
00:26:22.936 --> 00:26:24.070
Never?

494
00:26:24.737 --> 00:26:26.372
Okay, input completed.

495
00:26:32.212 --> 00:26:34.047
It tastes good because I eat it after exercising.

496
00:26:40.553 --> 00:26:42.122
It's really delicious, yeah

497
00:26:42.188 --> 00:26:43.890
The noodles are sticky, right?

498
00:26:44.390 --> 00:26:46.759
The person who cooked it is a fan of mine.

499
00:26:47.393 --> 00:26:48.561
I see.

500
00:26:52.265 --> 00:26:53.533
Ah, funny

501
00:26:54.701 --> 00:26:56.603
Why order it, why eat it?

502
00:26:57.370 --> 00:26:59.539
Are you going to just eat noodles?
Can I have some soup too?

503
00:26:59.606 --> 00:27:02.542
If you eat it with kimchi on top,
It's really delicious

504
00:27:02.609 --> 00:27:05.445
Why are you just watching me eat?
It's delicious

505
00:27:05.512 --> 00:27:08.648
Ha, the pizza I ate yesterday
You have to pay for your sins too

506
00:27:08.715 --> 00:27:10.383
Because of the drama production presentation

507
00:27:10.450 --> 00:27:12.152
음, 드라마?

508
00:27:13.853 --> 00:27:15.188
챙겨 볼까, 나도?

509
00:27:15.255 --> 00:27:17.524
- 제목이 뭔데요?
- '굶주린 사랑'

510
00:27:17.590 --> 00:27:19.492
아, 어쩌다 그랬대

511
00:27:19.559 --> 00:27:20.593
That's right

512
00:27:20.994 --> 00:27:22.695
Nothing's wrong, right?

513
00:27:24.264 --> 00:27:26.766
왜 그러는데? I know I have to say it

514
00:27:28.101 --> 00:27:30.537
Oh, as long as you don’t eat the soup

515
00:27:31.171 --> 00:27:32.438
Isn’t it possible?

516
00:27:33.973 --> 00:27:35.642
Do you have any ramen broth tea bags?

517
00:27:35.708 --> 00:27:37.076
You always carry it with you.

518
00:27:37.477 --> 00:27:38.811
What did you say?

519
00:27:44.617 --> 00:27:46.452
티백 없냐고

520
00:27:47.587 --> 00:27:48.721
I'll go

521
00:27:49.422 --> 00:27:50.456
No...

522
00:27:56.729 --> 00:27:58.731
나 그래도 배우고

523
00:27:58.798 --> 00:28:00.266
신념 있고

524
00:28:00.733 --> 00:28:04.037
Let's never go beyond ourselves
There is a line drawn

525
00:28:06.206 --> 00:28:07.073
yes

526
00:28:07.140 --> 00:28:10.443
I keep pushing it away because I can’t do it.
They keep recommending it to me

527
00:28:10.510 --> 00:28:12.812
Just crossing the line
한입만 먹어 보래

528
00:28:13.613 --> 00:28:15.114
So what should I do?

529
00:28:15.181 --> 00:28:16.683
Do you push it out of line?

530
00:28:16.749 --> 00:28:18.551
Because it’s not polite to keep refusing.

531
00:28:18.618 --> 00:28:21.120
I'll just close my eyes and take just one bite.

532
00:28:21.187 --> 00:28:23.289
They said never give it to me.

533
00:28:23.356 --> 00:28:24.924
I did as I was told

534
00:28:24.991 --> 00:28:27.360
Pretending I can't win, I can't help it

535
00:28:28.361 --> 00:28:29.762
just one chopstick

536
00:28:30.597 --> 00:28:32.031
That's enough

537
00:28:35.802 --> 00:28:39.005
I was called by Mr. Mo Tae-rin.
I came without even asking why

